# Internal working notes: the design decision record and the discoverability research.
# Kept on disk, not published. The user-facing versions of this material live in
# website/src/content/docs/ and ship with the site.
#
# The leading slash anchors this to the repository root. Without it the pattern also matches
# website/src/content/docs/, which would silently publish a documentation site with no
# documentation in it.
/docs/

